{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57028","headline":"唐时人爲秘书省太常寺官语（题从《古谣谚》卷六七） · 佚名","name":"唐时人爲秘书省太常寺官语（题从《古谣谚》卷六七）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"正字校书，咏诗骑驴。\n奉礼太祝，轻裘食肉。\n（见《翰苑新书前集》卷二十四引《雍洛灵异记》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57028.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57028","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}